When we were attacked by Yagditha's messengers, I made several psychic sweeps with the Elemental Priestesses, looking for traces of Midranda, but with no success. However, during the attack of the lizards infected by Yagditha, I sensed Midranda's aura.

It was brief, but I am sure he is hiding in the Abyss of the Sea. We need to find his exact location.
And your part will be key to our plans.

Please, talk to the mermaid Marina in the Abyss of the Sea; she is our contact among the water people and will update you on the situation. But be patient; she can be a little harsh with strangers.
